{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"海關上水深水埗檢265萬元私煙　拘捕3人\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CUST-CIGAR-261111-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】海關搗破3個私煙儲存倉庫，檢獲59萬支私煙，拘捕3人。</p><p>行動中，兩名26歲及37歲內地男子及一名67歲本地女子被捕。</p><p>海關周二及周三分別在上水及深水埗截停涉案人士，在他們身上發現私煙，進一步搜查後，再在地舖、唐樓及劏房單位檢獲共59萬支私煙，市值265萬元，應課稅值195萬元。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.681730+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:21:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:56:04.618394+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:48.221210+00:00","content_hash":"39e83e6640e7162861cb38e0f58e0d553c774307269ef0b1199bd6b3d76f4871","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}